{"seq":2,"slug":"marine-ecosystem-ecology","title":"海洋生态系统生态学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/marine-biology-ecology/marine-ecosystem-ecology","wordCount":1850,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"海洋生态系统生态学\">海洋生态系统生态学</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><h3 id=\"海洋食物网结构与能量流动\">海洋食物网结构与能量流动</h3><p>海洋食物网的基础是浮游植物通过光合作用固定的初级生产力。全球海洋年初级生产力约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50 \\times 10^{9}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> t C，其中约 90% 由微型浮游植物（如硅藻、甲藻、颗石藻）贡献。经典食物链遵循&quot;浮游植物→浮游动物→小型鱼类→大型掠食鱼类&quot;的营养级递进模式，每一级的能量传递效率约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span>（Lindeman 定律）。</p>\n<p>微食物环（microbial loop）的发现彻底改变了对海洋碳流动的认识。细菌利用溶解有机碳（DOC）再矿化，通过原生动物（鞭毛虫、纤毛虫）将能量重新引入经典食物链。在寡营养海域，微食物环可占总碳通量的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span> 以上。病毒裂解（viral lysis）每天释放全球海洋细菌生物量的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>—<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span></span></span></span></span>，形成 DOC 的短路循环。</p>\n<p>营养级联效应（trophic cascade）在海洋系统中表现显著。顶级掠食者的移除可导致中级消费者爆发、进而抑制初级生产者。经典案例包括北太平洋海獭-海胆-海藻林系统，以及过度捕捞导致的水母暴发现象。</p>\n<h3 id=\"海洋生物地球化学循环\">海洋生物地球化学循环</h3><p>海洋碳循环包括三个主要泵机制：生物泵（biological pump）、溶解度泵（solubility pump）和碳酸盐泵（carbonate pump）。生物泵通过浮游植物光合作用将表层 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 固定为有机碳颗粒（POC），经沉降将碳输送到深海。全球生物泵的碳输出通量约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><msup><mtext> Gt C yr</mtext><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\text{ Gt C yr}^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0818em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> Gt C yr</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>氮循环中，固氮作用（主要由束毛藻 <em>Trichodesmium</em> 和 UCYN 完成）向海洋输入约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>140</mn><msup><mtext> Tg N yr</mtext><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">140\\text{ Tg N yr}^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0818em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">140</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> Tg N yr</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，与反硝化和厌氧氨氧化的氮损失大致平衡。磷循环主要受陆源风化输入控制，海洋 N:P 比值（Redfield ratio）约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。硅循环对硅藻主导的海域尤为关键，硅酸盐的再溶解深度决定了深层硅的再循环效率。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>C:N:P:Si</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>106</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>15</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Redfield-Brzezinski ratio</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C:N:P:Si} = 106:16:1:15 \\quad (\\text{Redfield-Brzezinski ratio})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C:N:P:Si</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">106</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Redfield-Brzezinski ratio</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"珊瑚礁生态系统\">珊瑚礁生态系统</h3><p>珊瑚礁覆盖面积不到海洋的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1%</span></span></span></span></span>，却支持了约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25%</span></span></span></span></span> 的海洋物种多样性，被称为&quot;海洋中的热带雨林&quot;。造礁珊瑚与虫黄藻（<em>Symbiodiniaceae</em>）的共生关系是珊瑚礁生产力的核心：虫黄藻提供珊瑚 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span> 以上的能量需求。</p>\n<p>珊瑚白化是对热压力的应激反应，当海水温度持续超过夏季最高月平均温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span> 以上（即 DHW 达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>-weeks），珊瑚排出共生藻导致白化。2023-2024 年全球第四次大规模白化事件影响了超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">75\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">75%</span></span></span></span></span> 的全球珊瑚礁。</p>\n<p>珊瑚礁恢复策略包括：辅助基因流动（assisted gene flow）、耐热珊瑚品系筛选、珊瑚幼虫播种（larval reseeding）、人工礁基质（3D 打印结构）和微生物组工程（probiotic intervention）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"红树林与海草床生态功能\">红树林与海草床生态功能</h3><p>红树林是热带-亚热带潮间带的关键生态系统，单位面积碳储量是陆地热带雨林的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>—<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 倍（蓝碳生态系统）。全球红树林面积约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14.8</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mtext> km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14.8 \\times 10^4 \\text{ km}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，年碳埋藏量约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>22.8</mn><msup><mtext> Tg C yr</mtext><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">22.8\\text{ Tg C yr}^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0818em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">22.8</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> Tg C yr</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。红树林根系为鱼类和甲壳类提供育幼场，每公顷红树林可支持近岸渔业产量增加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.15</span></span></span></span></span>—<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.89</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.89</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.89</span></span></span></span></span> t。</p>\n<p>海草床覆盖全球约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mtext> km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30 \\times 10^4 \\text{ km}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，通过叶片减缓水流、根系稳固沉积物来减少海岸侵蚀。海草的碳封存速率可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>138</mn><msup><mtext> g C m</mtext><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mtext> yr</mtext><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">138 \\text{ g C m}^{-2}\\text{ yr}^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0818em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">138</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> g C m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> yr</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，且沉积碳可保存数千年。海草床退化的主要驱动因素包括富营养化、疏浚作业和气候变暖。</p>\n<h3 id=\"深海热液喷口生物群落\">深海热液喷口生物群落</h3><p>深海热液喷口（hydrothermal vent）生态系统完全依赖化学自养微生物的化能合成驱动，独立于太阳能。主要化能自养过程为硫氧化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>S</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msubsup><mtext>SO</mtext><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mtext>H</mtext><mo>+</mo></msup><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>798</mn><mtext> kJ/mol</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{H}_2\\text{S} + 2\\text{O}_2 \\rightarrow \\text{SO}_4^{2-} + 2\\text{H}^+ \\quad \\Delta G = -798 \\text{ kJ/mol}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1343em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">798</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> kJ/mol</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>管虫（<em>Riftia pachyptila</em>）通过体内共生硫氧化细菌获取有机碳，生长速率超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>85</mn><msup><mtext> cm yr</mtext><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">85 \\text{ cm yr}^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">85</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> cm yr</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。热液喷口动物群具有极高的特有率（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span>），物种扩散主要依赖洋脊连通性和幼虫漂移。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;浮游植物光合作用&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;浮游动物摄食&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;小型鱼类&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;顶级掠食者&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;DOC释放&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;细菌分解&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;原生动物&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; B&#10;    D --&gt; H[&quot;碎屑沉降&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;深海底栖生物&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"浮游植物光合作用\"] --&gt; B[\"浮游动物摄食\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"小型鱼类\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"顶级掠食者\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"DOC释放\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"细菌分解\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"原生动物\"]\n    G --&gt; B\n    D --&gt; H[\"碎屑沉降\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"深海底栖生物\"]</pre><h3 id=\"海洋保护区设计原则\">海洋保护区设计原则</h3><p>海洋保护区（MPA）设计遵循&quot;CARES&quot;准则：连通性（Connectivity）、面积充足（Adequacy）、代表性（Representativeness）、高效管理（Efficiency）和可持续性（Sustainability）。全球 MPA 覆盖率已从 2020 年的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7.7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7.7\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7.7%</span></span></span></span></span> 提升至 2025 年的约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8.4\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8.4%</span></span></span></span></span>，但距离&quot;30×30&quot;目标（2030 年保护 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span> 海洋）仍有较大差距。</p>\n<p>完全禁捕保护区（no-take zone）内，鱼类生物量平均增加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>670</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">670\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">670%</span></span></span></span></span>，物种丰富度增加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>21</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">21\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">21%</span></span></span></span></span>。溢出效应（spillover effect）可使保护区周边渔业受益。网络化设计需考虑幼虫扩散距离（通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>—<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> km）和遗传连通性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2025-2026 年，海洋生态系统研究的重要进展包括：联合国公海生物多样性协定（BBNJ Treaty）进入批准实施阶段，为公海海洋保护区的建立提供了法律框架。环境 DNA（eDNA）宏基因组技术实现了对整个海洋生物群落的快速无损监测，单次水样可检测数百物种。</p>\n<p>深海采矿的环境影响评估成为焦点，国际海底管理局（ISA）就 Clarion-Clipperton Zone 的多金属结核开采规则进行辩论。研究表明深海底栖生态系统的恢复时间尺度为数十年到数百年，采矿造成的沉积物羽流可扩散数百公里。</p>\n<p>人工智能在海洋生态学中的应用加速：深度学习模型用于浮游生物自动分类（准确率 &gt; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span>）、珊瑚健康状态评估、以及基于声学数据的鲸类种群监测。数字孪生海洋（Digital Twin Ocean）项目试图构建全球海洋生态系统的实时模拟框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>在寡营养开阔大洋中，微食物环对碳循环的贡献为何大于经典食物链？请从 DOC 浓度、细菌碳需求和营养盐再生角度分析。</li>\n<li>假设全球平均海表温度上升 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>，请预测珊瑚礁、红树林和深海热液喷口三种生态系统各自可能的响应差异。</li>\n<li>设计一个面积为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn><msup><mtext> km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500 \\text{ km}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的海洋保护区网络，需要考虑哪些生态连通性参数？如何权衡保护目标与渔业利益？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>海洋生态系统生态学揭示了从微食物环到顶级掠食者、从表层到深渊的多尺度生物-环境交互机制。生物地球化学循环将海洋物质流动与全球气候变化紧密耦合。在人类世面临气候变暖、海洋酸化和生物多样性丧失的多重压力下，基于生态学原理的保护区设计和蓝碳生态系统管理成为实现海洋可持续发展的核心策略。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"海洋生态系统生态学","id":"海洋生态系统生态学"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"海洋食物网结构与能量流动","id":"海洋食物网结构与能量流动"},{"level":3,"text":"海洋生物地球化学循环","id":"海洋生物地球化学循环"},{"level":3,"text":"珊瑚礁生态系统","id":"珊瑚礁生态系统"},{"level":3,"text":"红树林与海草床生态功能","id":"红树林与海草床生态功能"},{"level":3,"text":"深海热液喷口生物群落","id":"深海热液喷口生物群落"},{"level":3,"text":"海洋保护区设计原则","id":"海洋保护区设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"海洋生物多样性","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/marine-biology-ecology/marine-biodiversity"},"next":{"title":"海洋生物技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/marine-biology-ecology/marine-biotechnology"}}